516
00:27:38,584 --> 00:27:40,044
Small Trials Are Dangerous.

517
00:27:41,304 --> 00:27:44,504
Phase three trials test one thousand to three thousand patients.

518
00:27:45,164 --> 00:27:49,804
A one-in-ten-thousand adverse event is mathematically invisible in a trial

519
00:27:49,804 --> 00:27:50,644
of three thousand.

520
00:27:51,564 --> 00:27:53,244
Then the drug goes to millions.

521
00:27:54,044 --> 00:27:55,764
After approval, the F.D.A.

522
00:27:55,844 --> 00:27:57,964
monitors safety using the F.D.A.

523
00:27:58,144 --> 00:28:02,924
