525
00:28:06,004 --> 00:28:09,364
It captures less than ten percent of actual adverse events.

526
00:28:10,244 --> 00:28:15,184
Vioxx killed an estimated thirty-eight thousand to fifty-five thousand Americans

527
00:28:15,184 --> 00:28:17,884
